privacy='''<article class="legal"><span class="kicker">Information / Legal</span><h1>Privacy <em>Policy.</em></h1><p>Last updated: 23 November 2026</p><h2>Who we are</h2><p>Dhanushree Timbers & Furnitures offers furniture, timber and woodwork enquiries in Kuttalam, Mayiladuthurai, Tamil Nadu. Our registered address is listed on the <a href="contact.html"><u>Contact page</u></a>.</p><h2>Information you share</h2><p>If you contact us, you may choose to share your name, contact details, product preferences, dimensions or delivery area. Our custom enquiry form prepares a WhatsApp message in your browser; filling it in alone does not send the information to us. You decide whether to send the message using WhatsApp.</p><h2>How we use information</h2><p>We use information you provide to reply to questions, discuss specifications, prepare quotations, and arrange agreed orders or delivery where applicable. Standard technical information may also be processed by website hosting providers to operate the site.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Our site links to WhatsApp, Instagram, IndiaMART and Google Maps. These services have their own privacy policies. The site also requests fonts from Google Fonts and illustrative images from Pexels, so these services may receive standard technical request information, such as your IP address. We do not operate user accounts or accept online card payments through this site.</p><h2>Retention and choices</h2><p>You may contact us to request access, correction or deletion of personal information you previously provided, subject to applicable legal obligations and business-record requirements. We do not sell customer contact details.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:reachdhanushreetimbers@gmail.com"><u>reachdhanushreetimbers@gmail.com</u></a> or call <a href="tel:+919159390999"><u>+91 91593 90999</u></a>.</p></article>'''
page('Privacy Policy | Dhanushree Timbers & Furnitures','How Dhanushree Timbers handles enquiries, contact information and third-party services used on the website.','privacy-policy.html',privacy,'legal-page')
terms=f'''<article class="legal"><span class="kicker">Information / Legal</span><h1>Terms &<br><em>Conditions.</em></h1><p>Last updated: 23 November 2026</p><h2>Website use</h2><p>This website introduces Dhanushree Timbers & Furnitures and lets visitors enquire about selected timber, furniture and woodwork categories. Content is informational and may change without notice.</p><h2>Images, models and availability</h2><p>{PHOTO_DISCLAIMER} The interactive 3D joinery study on the homepage is a conceptual visual illustration, not an actual product, verified workshop photograph or an offer to sell a specific item. Product listings here are a selection and not the entire inventory.</p><h2>Orders and quotations</h2><p>No online checkout or payment is accepted through this website. Enquiries do not create an order or guarantee availability. Prices, sizes, material specifications, finish, lead time, payment terms and any service charges must be confirmed directly before an order is agreed.</p><h2>Custom orders</h2><p>Made-to-order items depend on feasibility, accurate measurements, material availability and the final agreed specification. Any delivery timeframe or special requirements must be discussed before confirmation. Do not rely on reference photos as precise product specifications.</p><h2>Delivery</h2><p>Delivery within approximately 40 km of Kuttalam may be available. Beyond 40 km, availability and charges depend on destination, product, and arrangements. Please confirm charges and coverage before ordering.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Links to WhatsApp, Instagram, IndiaMART, Pexels, Google Maps and other third parties are provided for convenience. Those services have their own terms and policies.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions? Reach us at <a href="mailto:reachdhanushreetimbers@gmail.com"><u>reachdhanushreetimbers@gmail.com</u></a> or <a href="tel:+919159390999"><u>+91 91593 90999</u></a>.</p></article>'''
